<nav class="toc-nav" aria-label="Table of contents"><ul><li><div class="toc-row" title="Mote 设计文档" style="--toc-depth:0"><button class="toc-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="mote-toc-group-0" aria-label="Toggle subheadings: Mote 设计文档" hidden><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 3 5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><a href="#mote-设计文档">Mote 设计文档</a></div><ul class="toc-branch" id="mote-toc-group-0"><li><div class="toc-row" title="背景" style="--toc-depth:1"><a href="#背景">背景</a></div></li><li><div class="toc-row" title="小结" style="--toc-depth:1"><a href="#小结">小结</a></div></li></ul></li></ul></nav>
